WEBVTT

00:05:58.538 --> 00:06:01.413
because you can't call them
playdates when the boys are 17.

00:06:01.454 --> 00:06:02.621
(Laughter)

00:06:02.663 --> 00:06:06.246
But his brother, Boaz --
Bo was loving life!

00:06:06.288 --> 00:06:08.621
"Ma, this is fantastic!

00:06:08.663 --> 00:06:11.204
I don't ever have to leave my bed!"

00:06:12.163 --> 00:06:15.913
My boys couldn't be more different,
and so are your workers,

00:06:15.954 --> 00:06:19.746
so we must get data.

00:06:19.788 --> 00:06:22.371
How? Well, try this.

00:06:22.413 --> 00:06:25.496
Get some of your best people
together and ask them,

00:06:25.538 --> 00:06:28.204
"What did you love about
these last 18 months?

00:06:28.246 --> 00:06:29.496
What did you hate?

00:06:29.538 --> 00:06:31.246
If we were to give you a magic wand